    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 35">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 35</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðu fioh to borge selle þinum geferan, þe mid þe eardian wille, ne niede ðu hine swa swa niedling ⁊ ne gehene þu hine mid ðy eacan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If you give property to be borrowed by your fellow, who will dwell with you, do not oppress him like a slave and do not abuse him with interest.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif þu feoh to borge sylle þinum geferan, þe mid þe eardian wylle, ne nyde þu hine swa nydling ⁊ ne gehyn þu hine mid þy eacan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
